{"5121150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Twilight Tavern", "steam_appid": 5121150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventurers have been robbing shopkeepers their whole lives. Tonight, <strong>you're behind the counter</strong> and they're the ones <strong>trying to talk you down</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tavern</strong> is a <strong>cozy first-person shop sim</strong> about the six hours between 8 PM and 2 AM. Light the door lantern, open up, and see who wanders in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/c75c3219e7bb982c65301b34561c47df.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/c75c3219e7bb982c65301b34561c47df.avif?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CUSTOMER IS A NEGOTIATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a customer asks for something, you <strong>negotiate price</strong> and they answer. Ask too much and <strong>they counter</strong>. Push further and they <strong>walk away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three kinds of buyer sit across the counter from you, and each haggles differently. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cheap Buyer <strong>lowballs</strong> you at  whatever you ask. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rich Impatient Buyer <strong>might</strong> just say yes or meet you at their limit and go no further. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Suspicious Buyer <strong>negotiates hard</strong> and pays in coin you should probably look at twice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get <strong>two or three attempts</strong> per customer. Spend them well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/d54b7d65cdea965eb31bd10d6c439f94.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/d54b7d65cdea965eb31bd10d6c439f94.webp?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN WHO WALKS THROUGH THE DOOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifteen named regulars across ten hand-built species: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grim reapers </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vampires</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >witches </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ghosts </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >goblin peddlers </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a drifting jellyfish </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hopping mushroom monk</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a snail who takes his time. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They come back, and <strong>the shop remembers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/5a88e5e78840be73c3f5e161b4ee26ca.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/5a88e5e78840be73c3f5e161b4ee26ca.avif?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order stock</strong> from <strong>Moss &amp; Moon Wholesale</strong>, or forage ingredients from <strong>Thornwick</strong> and <strong>craft</strong> the things nobody else sells like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonroot Salve </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfire Elixir</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warding Charms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonfire Lamp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six recipes unlock as you grow, and the later ones need the earlier ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regulars will commission work directly: craft it, shelve it, and they return the next night to collect at the price you agreed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/8e95f7436c7299b575b8eae01f551c67.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/8e95f7436c7299b575b8eae01f551c67.webp?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN IT WITH YOUR HANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shop <strong>you physically work</strong>. <strong>Carry</strong> products from the backroom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot</strong> them onto shelves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a customer buys something, walk over, take it off the shelf, and <strong>hand it across the counter yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy bigger shelves, rearrange them, and fill the room with rugs, barrels, an armchair, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Name the place whatever you like.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/2fe9e6e290ca06a6bb264cf271304eeb.avif?t=1787823192\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > SOME COINS ARE FAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell to the wrong customer and the payment turns worthless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>lose revenue and your product</strong> to a <strong>scammer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tip: Watch out for what they say, <strong>you are the judge of character</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/9f2b03676d0705c5b54782b78da25194.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/9f2b03676d0705c5b54782b78da25194.webp?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventurers have been robbing shopkeepers their whole lives. Tonight, <strong>you're behind the counter</strong> and they're the ones <strong>trying to talk you down</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tavern</strong> is a <strong>cozy first-person shop sim</strong> about the six hours between 8 PM and 2 AM. Light the door lantern, open up, and see who wanders in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/c75c3219e7bb982c65301b34561c47df.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/c75c3219e7bb982c65301b34561c47df.avif?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CUSTOMER IS A NEGOTIATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a customer asks for something, you <strong>negotiate price</strong> and they answer. Ask too much and <strong>they counter</strong>. Push further and they <strong>walk away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three kinds of buyer sit across the counter from you, and each haggles differently. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cheap Buyer <strong>lowballs</strong> you at  whatever you ask. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rich Impatient Buyer <strong>might</strong> just say yes or meet you at their limit and go no further. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Suspicious Buyer <strong>negotiates hard</strong> and pays in coin you should probably look at twice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get <strong>two or three attempts</strong> per customer. Spend them well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/d54b7d65cdea965eb31bd10d6c439f94.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/d54b7d65cdea965eb31bd10d6c439f94.webp?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN WHO WALKS THROUGH THE DOOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifteen named regulars across ten hand-built species: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grim reapers </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vampires</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >witches </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ghosts </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >goblin peddlers </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a drifting jellyfish </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hopping mushroom monk</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a snail who takes his time. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They come back, and <strong>the shop remembers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/5a88e5e78840be73c3f5e161b4ee26ca.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/5a88e5e78840be73c3f5e161b4ee26ca.avif?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order stock</strong> from <strong>Moss &amp; Moon Wholesale</strong>, or forage ingredients from <strong>Thornwick</strong> and <strong>craft</strong> the things nobody else sells like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonroot Salve </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfire Elixir</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warding Charms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonfire Lamp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six recipes unlock as you grow, and the later ones need the earlier ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regulars will commission work directly: craft it, shelve it, and they return the next night to collect at the price you agreed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/8e95f7436c7299b575b8eae01f551c67.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/8e95f7436c7299b575b8eae01f551c67.webp?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN IT WITH YOUR HANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shop <strong>you physically work</strong>. <strong>Carry</strong> products from the backroom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot</strong> them onto shelves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a customer buys something, walk over, take it off the shelf, and <strong>hand it across the counter yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy bigger shelves, rearrange them, and fill the room with rugs, barrels, an armchair, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Name the place whatever you like.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/2fe9e6e290ca06a6bb264cf271304eeb.avif?t=1787823192\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > SOME COINS ARE FAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell to the wrong customer and the payment turns worthless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>lose revenue and your product</strong> to a <strong>scammer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tip: Watch out for what they say, <strong>you are the judge of character</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras/9f2b03676d0705c5b54782b78da25194.avif?t=1787823192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/extras_big/9f2b03676d0705c5b54782b78da25194.webp?t=1787823192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A cozy first-person shopkeeper sim. Stock your shelves, haggle over every price with customers that are vampires, grim reapers, ghosts, witches and craft what they ask for. Grow the tavern into a business worth remembering. Just watch the coin: not all of it is real.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/710e1da421315de384f5c88b6fbd48efbf41fffc/header.jpg?t=1787823192", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/ed43a082ec7b5d346edb4271bc35120a3a1081d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787823192", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/ed43a082ec7b5d346edb4271bc35120a3a1081d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787823192", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 or AMD Radeon R7 370, 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Twilight Tavern © 2026 Milen. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Siyesh Games"], "publishers": ["Siyesh Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/b287958f55eb0f6b1683df4f18d88f1712590b5f/ss_b287958f55eb0f6b1683df4f18d88f1712590b5f.600x338.jpg?t=1787823192", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/b287958f55eb0f6b1683df4f18d88f1712590b5f/ss_b287958f55eb0f6b1683df4f18d88f1712590b5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787823192"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5121150/6823da88fae6737c1e73f887f256c813a6b7fc2f/ss_6823da88fae6737c1e73f887f256c813a6b7fc2f.600x338.jpg?t=1787823192", "path_full": "